

## Kode Brain

This project has a Kode Brain knowledge map at `docs/brain/projects/kodebrain/`.

Before starting: read `docs/brain/projects/kodebrain/kodebrain.md` (project hub) and the
relevant domain pages under `docs/brain/projects/kodebrain/domains/`.
Check `docs/brain/projects/kodebrain/changes/active/` for in-progress changes.
Check `docs/brain/projects/kodebrain/reports/reading-packs/` for a pre-built context pack.

KB-first rule: start from project hub and relevant domains. Use targeted source for
edits and verification. For material changes, create a change record before implementing.
After implementation, reconcile the KB and surface drift.
